# Renault 21 phase 2 saloon, 1989-1994.
#
# The phase-2 facelift of the Renault 21, on sale from May 1989. The saloon
# petrol range ended in early 1994, when the Laguna replaced it. It is the same
# shell as the phase-1 car with a fuller nose, larger lamps, body-coloured
# bumpers and wider tail lamps, and was built as a variant of the phase-1
# master rather than as a new model.
#
# Dimensions 4.462 x 1.715 x 1.415 m, wheelbase 2.600 m, unchanged from phase 1.
# Source: the reference pack's notes, from the Renault 21 dimension box.
#
# What differs from phase 1: a fuller, more rounded nose with a wide grille
# carrying the diamond, larger wrap-around headlamps, a body-coloured bumper
# with a dark insert and a bright strip, and at the rear wider tail lamps with
# a dark centre panel between them. The cabin, doors, roof, wheels and the rest
# of the flank are the phase-1 master's.
#
# Shape reference: a cream UK phase-2 saloon front-left, a maroon phase-2
# saloon front-right and the cream car from the rear left. No true side
# elevation exists, so the model was compared at each photograph's angle and a
# true elevation was rendered for coherence.
#
# Colours: no British-market names were established, so the objects carry plain
# names: silver, red, blue and white. Weights silver 3, red 3, blue 2, white 2,
# total 10, provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 180 km/h and comfort 75/443, as the phase-1 car. Classes 1,2,3.
#
# Dates are road presence: May 1989 intro, retires staggered 2004-2007 on a
# fifteen- to eighteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/renault-21-phase2.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/renault-21-phase2.dae (124 objects). References:
# citycars/references/renault-21-phase2/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the carried-over body remains slab-sided and the lamp
# and bumper transitions squarer than the photographs. At 128 px the fuller
# nose and the dark centre panel between the tail lamps distinguish it from the
# phase-1 car.

obj=citycar
name=Renault21Phase2(Silver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1989
intro_month=5
retire_year=2007
retire_month=6
speed=180
class=1,2,3
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=75
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=443

